  "hit": "Scored on the Text's area in the view read (phone for CAP-R2PHONE, desktop for CAP-R2CORNERS), at the drop (held) and after Escape (let go); each case's two reads must agree. The section's rows are read, not scored. A 'before' read off ours' start is a setup miss, named, not scored.",
